Follow AGENTS.md and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.

`ferrum-core-types` interface revision 1 is frozen. Do not change public types, trait methods, error-to-HTTP mapping, or the OpenAI wire format unless the user asks.

`unsafe` is allowed only in `crates/kernels` and the mmap layer of `crates/gguf`. Every block needs a `// SAFETY:` comment that states the invariant.

Inference runs on dedicated OS threads. Do not run it on the actix or tokio runtime.

docs/STATUS.md records measured results only. A milestone that has not been run stays "not run".
